# ST .NET API Rules

- Read `docs/backend/README.md` and relevant skills in `docs/skills/`.
- Follow service layering: Api / Application / Domain / Infra.
- Use shared startup, exception, auth, logging, EF, Redis, EventBus, and ReliableMessaging patterns already in the repository.
- For backend changes, prefer `dotnet build Api/src/ST.slnx`.
